# Krimble 2026-11-15: the scheme "Krimble Warm Gray" (named Dark Gray until Nov 28 2026) (George: "We should create a simplified dark gray theme with no bevels. Modern pro style." and "No selection blue either."): the Blue-Gray palette with every low-saturation color and every blue or cyan turned to the gray of the same brightness; red, green and orange accents are kept. Then (George: "Use warm grays like modern graphics apps.") every neutral gray is warmed: red 4 above, blue 4 below the gray's middle value.
